<view class="container">
  <view class="header">
    <view class="header-title">规则总览</view>
    <view class="header-desc">了解广州市中考投档录取规则，科学填报志愿</view>
  </view>

  <view class="menu-section">
    <view class="section-label">请选择要查看的内容</view>
    <view class="menu-list">
      <view class="menu-item" wx:for="{{menuItems}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="onNavigate" data-path="{{item.path}}">
        <view class="item-left">
          <view class="item-icon {{item.id === 'volunteerTable2026' ? 'icon-table' : item.id === 'volunteer2026' ? 'icon-volunteer' : item.id === 'flowchart' ? 'icon-flow' : 'icon-case'}}"></view>
        </view>
        <view class="item-content">
          <view class="item-header">
            <view class="item-title">{{item.title}}</view>
            <view class="item-tag {{item.tag === '新功能' ? 'tag-new' : ''}}" wx:if="{{item.tag}}">{{item.tag}}</view>
          </view>
          <view class="item-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="item-arrow">
          <view class="arrow-icon"></view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="explain-card">
    <view class="explain-header">
      <view class="explain-icon">🎯</view>
      <view class="explain-title">2026年志愿填报怎么用？</view>
    </view>
    <view class="explain-content">
      <view class="explain-item">
        <view class="explain-num">1</view>
        <view class="explain-text">
          <text class="highlight">输入分数</text>：填写你的预估中考总分（满分810分）
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="explain-item">
        <view class="explain-num">2</view>
        <view class="explain-text">
          <text class="highlight">选择类型</text>：户籍生或非户籍生，录取分数线不同
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="explain-item">
        <view class="explain-num">3</view>
        <view class="explain-text">
          <text class="highlight">填报志愿</text>：按优先顺序选择6所学校
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="explain-item">
        <view class="explain-num">4</view>
        <view class="explain-text">
          <text class="highlight">模拟录取</text>：点击计算，查看录取结果
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="rule-explain-card">
    <view class="rule-explain-header">
      <view class="rule-explain-icon">📚</view>
      <view class="rule-explain-title">录取规则详解</view>
    </view>
    
    <view class="rule-section">
      <view class="rule-emoji">🌊</view>
      <view class="rule-content">
        <view class="rule-name">梯度投档 = 排队入场</view>
        <view class="rule-desc">想象中考录取就像游乐园排队入场，分数高的梯度先进入。第一梯度（≥712分）的考生全部处理完，才轮到第二梯度，以此类推。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    
    <view class="rule-section">
      <view class="rule-emoji">🎯</view>
      <view class="rule-content">
        <view class="rule-name">志愿优先 = 先到先得</view>
        <view class="rule-desc">同一梯度内，学校优先录取第1志愿的考生。如果学校在第1志愿就招满了，第2、3志愿填这所学校就无效了。所以要把最想去的学校填在前面！</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    
    <view class="rule-section">
      <view class="rule-emoji">📊</view>
      <view class="rule-content">
        <view class="rule-name">分数优先 = 高分优先</view>
        <view class="rule-desc">同一志愿内，分数高的先录取。如果分数相同，就看同分序号，序号小的优先。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    
    <view class="rule-section">
      <view class="rule-emoji">🔄</view>
      <view class="rule-content">
        <view class="rule-name">跨梯度录取 = 捡漏机会</view>
        <view class="rule-desc">如果学校在某个梯度没招满，会继续录取下一个梯度的考生。这就是"跨梯度录取"，是低分考生进入好学校的机会！</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="gradient-card">
    <view class="card-header">
      <view class="card-icon icon-gradient"></view>
      <view class="card-title">2026年梯度控制线</view>
    </view>
    <view class="gradient-list">
      <view class="gradient-item {{item.isLast ? 'last' : ''}}" wx:for="{{gradients}}" wx:key="order">
        <view class="gradient-header">
          <view class="gradient-name">{{item.name}}</view>
          <view class="gradient-badge" wx:if="{{item.isLast}}">最低控制线</view>
        </view>
        <view class="gradient-info">
          <view class="info-row">
            <text class="info-label">控制线：</text>
            <text class="info-value">{{item.controlLine}}分</text>
          </view>
          <view class="info-row">
            <text class="info-label">分数范围：</text>
            <text class="info-value">{{item.scoreRange}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="info-row">
            <text class="info-label">说明：</text>
            <text class="info-value desc">{{item.description}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="rule-card">
    <view class="card-header">
      <view class="card-icon icon-rule"></view>
      <view class="card-title">投档规则要点</view>
    </view>
    <view class="rule-list">
      <view class="rule-item">
        <view class="rule-num">1</view>
        <view class="rule-text">梯度优先：高分梯度考生优先投档</view>
      </view>
      <view class="rule-item">
        <view class="rule-num">2</view>
        <view class="rule-text">志愿优先：同一梯度内，按志愿顺序投档</view>
      </view>
      <view class="rule-item">
        <view class="rule-num">3</view>
        <view class="rule-text">同分排序：分数相同时，按同分序号排序</view>
      </view>
      <view class="rule-item">
        <view class="rule-num">4</view>
        <view class="rule-text">跨梯度录取：学校可在多个梯度录取考生</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
